WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
In Settings → AI tools, allow control of Focus Studio.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Recheck the connection and confirm that MCP is ready.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:11.000
This Codex connection is already configured and ready to use.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Expand Manual configuration to copy the connection command.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.950
Start a new Codex conversation to record, edit and export.
